Here’s your **one‑page condensed cheat sheet** — just the essential commands, no explanations. Keep this handy to redo the setup from scratch:

---

## 🪜 Chainlit Setup & Patch Cheat Sheet

```powershell
# Clone repo
cd C:\Users\Immanuel\Desktop
git clone https://github.com/Chainlit/chainlit.git
cd chainlit

# Enable Corepack + pnpm
corepack enable
corepack prepare pnpm@latest --activate
pnpm --version

# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Add Markdown packages
cd frontend
pnpm add unified remark-parse remark remark-html remark-gfm dompurify

# Edit frontend code
cd src\components
# Create MarkdownRenderer.tsx (paste code)
# Edit Markdown.tsx (import + fallback + p override)

# Build shared library
cd C:\Users\Immanuel\Desktop\chainlit
pnpm --filter @chainlit/react-client build

# Build frontend
pnpm --filter @chainlit/app build

# Install backend Python package
cd backend
pip install -e .

# Run your app
cd C:\Users\Immanuel\Desktop\reasoning-from-scratch
.venv\Scripts\activate.ps1
uv run chainlit run chG/01_main-chapter-code/qwen3_chat_interface_multiturn.py
```

---

## 🛠️ Common Errors & Fixes

- **Unsupported URL Type "workspace:"** → Use `pnpm install` instead of `npm install`.  
- **EPERM: operation not permitted** → Run PowerShell as Administrator.  
- **Rollup failed to resolve import "unified"/"remark-parse"** → Install missing package with `pnpm add`.  
- **Multiple top-level packages discovered** → Run `pip install -e .` inside `backend`, not repo root.  
- **Access is denied (wavtools)** → Retry build as Administrator, disable antivirus if needed.  
- **Large bundle size warnings** → Ignore, build still succeeds.  

